  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2201801",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Sango",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220180101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220180101": {
            "id": "220180101",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "That seems to be the only possibility...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180102"
            ]
          },
          "220180102": {
            "id": "220180102",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Hmm... I need to find a few more clues...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180103"
            ]
          },
          "220180103": {
            "id": "220180103",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "How's the case been going?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180104"
            ]
          },
          "220180104": {
            "id": "220180104",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Oh-ho, Traveler. You're just in time. We've hit a critical point in our case.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180105"
            ]
          },
          "220180105": {
            "id": "220180105",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Thanks to Amano and Andou's actions, our culprit seems convinced that the Doushin's investigation is directed towards the Treasure Hoarders.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180106"
            ]
          },
          "220180106": {
            "id": "220180106",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "So the culprit is still committing crimes in the city from time to time, leaving a lot of tracks behind.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180107"
            ]
          },
          "220180107": {
            "id": "220180107",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "The culprit committed another crime yesterday. This time, the victim was Mr. Kanbei, the owner of Shimura's.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180108"
            ]
          },
          "220180108": {
            "id": "220180108",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "After discovering that the money had been stolen from the store, Mr. Kanbei was beside himself with rage — spent some time just yelling angrily outside, so I hear.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180109"
            ]
          },
          "220180109": {
            "id": "220180109",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "A few years ago, he might have gathered some help and gone to town to search for the thief in person.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180110"
            ]
          },
          "220180110": {
            "id": "220180110",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "It is a bold move indeed on the culprit's part to steal money from Mr. Kanbei...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180111"
            ]
          },
          "220180111": {
            "id": "220180111",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "The timing was quite clever too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180112"
            ]
          },
          "220180112": {
            "id": "220180112",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "He noticed that Mr. Kanbei would close his store every few days so he could have a drink.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180113"
            ]
          },
          "220180113": {
            "id": "220180113",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "So after Mr. Kanbei got drunk, they took the money in the store and strolled out leisurely.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180114"
            ]
          },
          "220180114": {
            "id": "220180114",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Kanbei has been coming over for several days to ask me to find the culprit. Honestly, I'm getting sick of that loud voice of his.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180115"
            ]
          },
          "220180115": {
            "id": "220180115",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "As such, I'd like to ask you and Ryuuji to go check out how he's doing and listen to, well, his complaints.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180116"
            ]
          },
          "220180116": {
            "id": "220180116",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "After that, go ask around if anyone saw or heard anything while the theft was ongoing at Shimura's.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180117"
            ]
          },
          "220180117": {
            "id": "220180117",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Come back and tell me when you're done. I'll be here waiting for you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2201802",
      "subQuestName": "Ask Yayoi Nanatsuki for clues",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220180201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220180201": {
            "id": "220180201",
            "speakerId": 3001,
            "speakerName": "Yayoi Nanatsuki",
            "text": "Hi, what can I do for you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180202"
            ]
          },
          "220180202": {
            "id": "220180202",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I want to ask about the burglary at Shimura's...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180203"
            ]
          },
          "220180203": {
            "id": "220180203",
            "speakerId": 3001,
            "speakerName": "Yayoi Nanatsuki",
            "text": "Well, I sure did hear about it. It was hard not to hear Mr. Kanbei's angry voice...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180204"
            ]
          },
          "220180204": {
            "id": "220180204",
            "speakerId": 3001,
            "speakerName": "Yayoi Nanatsuki",
            "text": "Wait. Are you asking if I saw anything?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180205"
            ]
          },
          "220180205": {
            "id": "220180205",
            "speakerId": 3001,
            "speakerName": "Yayoi Nanatsuki",
            "text": "Sorry, I didn't... In fact, I didn't know about it until I was woken up by the sound of Mr. Kanbei's roaring...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180206"
            ]
          },
          "220180206": {
            "id": "220180206",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Were there any suspicious people around?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180207"
            ]
          },
          "220180207": {
            "id": "220180207",
            "speakerId": 3001,
            "speakerName": "Yayoi Nanatsuki",
            "text": "Suspicious people? Well... I didn't see anyone suspicious.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180208"
            ]
          },
          "220180208": {
            "id": "220180208",
            "speakerId": 3001,
            "speakerName": "Yayoi Nanatsuki",
            "text": "*sigh* I guess everyone around was woken up because of Mr. Kanbei's loud voice..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2201803",
      "subQuestName": "Ask Shimura Kanbei for clues",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220180301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220180301": {
            "id": "220180301",
            "speakerId": 3015,
            "speakerName": "Shimura Kanbei",
            "text": "Darn in... Who on earth would have done this...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180302"
            ]
          },
          "220180302": {
            "id": "220180302",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Are you Shimura Kanbei?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180303"
            ]
          },
          "220180303": {
            "id": "220180303",
            "speakerId": 3015,
            "speakerName": "Shimura Kanbei",
            "text": "Ah, yes, I am, and you are... Oh! If it isn't Ryuuji!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180304"
            ]
          },
          "220180304": {
            "id": "220180304",
            "speakerId": 3015,
            "speakerName": "Shimura Kanbei",
            "text": "Has Ms. Sango found out who that monster is? Why, I'm going to whoop that...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180305"
            ]
          },
          "220180305": {
            "id": "220180305",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "She has not found the culprit yet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180306"
            ]
          },
          "220180306": {
            "id": "220180306",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So, about the theft...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180307"
            ]
          },
          "220180307": {
            "id": "220180307",
            "speakerId": 3015,
            "speakerName": "Shimura Kanbei",
            "text": "I've told Ms. Sango everything that I know. I drank too much and fell asleep straight away.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180308"
            ]
          },
          "220180308": {
            "id": "220180308",
            "speakerId": 3015,
            "speakerName": "Shimura Kanbei",
            "text": "When I woke up, all the money in the store was gone!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180309"
            ]
          },
          "220180309": {
            "id": "220180309",
            "speakerId": 3015,
            "speakerName": "Shimura Kanbei",
            "text": "Curses... Who would do such a thing..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2201804",
      "subQuestName": "Ask Furuya Noboru for clues",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220180401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220180401": {
            "id": "220180401",
            "speakerId": 3005,
            "speakerName": "Furuya Noboru",
            "text": "Hmm? Is something the matter?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180402"
            ]
          },
          "220180402": {
            "id": "220180402",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "About the theft in Shimura's...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180403"
            ]
          },
          "220180403": {
            "id": "220180403",
            "speakerId": 3005,
            "speakerName": "Furuya Noboru",
            "text": "That? I heard about it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180404"
            ]
          },
          "220180404": {
            "id": "220180404",
            "speakerId": 3005,
            "speakerName": "Furuya Noboru",
            "text": "If you're looking for a witness, I'm sorry, I don't have any information of value.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180405"
            ]
          },
          "220180405": {
            "id": "220180405",
            "speakerId": 3005,
            "speakerName": "Furuya Noboru",
            "text": "I was busy working at the Adventurers' Guild at the time. I didn't go outside.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180406"
            ]
          },
          "220180406": {
            "id": "220180406",
            "speakerId": 3005,
            "speakerName": "Furuya Noboru",
            "text": "It was only after I heard Mr. Kanbei's shout that I went out to have a look. That's when I heard about the theft.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180407"
            ]
          },
          "220180407": {
            "id": "220180407",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Was there anyone around who seemed suspicious?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180408"
            ]
          },
          "220180408": {
            "id": "220180408",
            "speakerId": 3005,
            "speakerName": "Furuya Noboru",
            "text": "Suspicious?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180409"
            ]
          },
          "220180409": {
            "id": "220180409",
            "speakerId": 3005,
            "speakerName": "Furuya Noboru",
            "text": "Hmm... I'm sorry. I'm afraid wasn't paying close attention to that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180410"
            ]
          },
          "220180410": {
            "id": "220180410",
            "speakerId": 3005,
            "speakerName": "Furuya Noboru",
            "text": "You should probably ask someone else."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2201805",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Sango",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220180501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220180501": {
            "id": "220180501",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "You're back. How was it? Did you find anything out?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180502"
            ]
          },
          "220180502": {
            "id": "220180502",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Well... I see... Thank you. You did a great job.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180503"
            ]
          },
          "220180503": {
            "id": "220180503",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "This culprit really knows how to pick his targets. Aside from Mr. Kanbei, the owner of Netsuke no Gen Crafts, Mikoshi Genichirou, was also a victim.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180504"
            ]
          },
          "220180504": {
            "id": "220180504",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "When he left the store to visit his friends, the thief stole a lot of valuable things from within.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180505"
            ]
          },
          "220180505": {
            "id": "220180505",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Ah, right. Miss Yayoi's lacquerware store was also hit. When she went out on a delivery run, a lot of valuable lacquerware was stolen from the store.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180507"
            ]
          },
          "220180507": {
            "id": "220180507",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "That's right. But as you can see, there aren't many merchants or residents on this street. If a local committed the crime, someone would figure it out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180508"
            ]
          },
          "220180508": {
            "id": "220180508",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "But if it wasn't a local, how could the culprit be so precise about when the victims would leave their stores?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180510"
            ]
          },
          "220180510": {
            "id": "220180510",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "I also thought about that. After Amano and Andou checked the whereabouts of the surrounding households and businesses, the possibility of a local committing the crime has been ruled out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180511"
            ]
          },
          "220180511": {
            "id": "220180511",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "The locations of the crime were scattered. It seems like they were done on a whim by Treasure Hoarders roaming into the city...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180512"
            ]
          },
          "220180512": {
            "id": "220180512",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "But the methods used are so precise. It doesn't look like the Treasure Hoarders did it at all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180513"
            ]
          },
          "220180513": {
            "id": "220180513",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "I believe that... perhaps the thief personally scouted out and collected information about the lives of people around the city to make their plans...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180514"
            ]
          },
          "220180514": {
            "id": "220180514",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "As I said, there aren't many residents here and they all know each other. If there were any strangers, everyone would have noticed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
