            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "How's the case been going?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180604"
            ]
          },
          "220180604": {
            "id": "220180604",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Oh-ho, Traveler. You're just in time. We've hit a critical point in our case.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180605"
            ]
          },
          "220180605": {
            "id": "220180605",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Thanks to Amano and Andou's actions, our culprit seems convinced that the Doushin's investigation is directed towards the Treasure Hoarders.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180606"
            ]
          },
          "220180606": {
            "id": "220180606",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "So the culprit is still committing crimes in the city from time to time, leaving a lot of tracks behind.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180607"
            ]
          },
          "220180607": {
            "id": "220180607",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "The culprit committed another crime yesterday. This time, the victim was Mr. Kanbei, the owner of Shimura's.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180608"
            ]
          },
          "220180608": {
            "id": "220180608",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "After discovering that the Mora had been stolen from the store, Mr. Kanbei was beside himself with rage — spent some time just yelling angrily outside, so I hear.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180609"
            ]
          },
          "220180609": {
            "id": "220180609",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "A few years ago, he might have simply grabbed his sword and gone out to nab the culprit himself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180610"
            ]
          },
          "220180610": {
            "id": "220180610",
            "speakerId": 3042,
            "speakerName": "Ryuuji",
            "text": "It is a bold move indeed on the culprit's part to steal Mora from Mr. Kanbei...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180611"
            ]
          },
          "220180611": {
            "id": "220180611",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "The timing was quite clever too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180612"
            ]
          },
          "220180612": {
            "id": "220180612",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "He noticed that Mr. Kanbei would close his store every few days so he could have a drink.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180613"
            ]
          },
          "220180613": {
            "id": "220180613",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "So after Mr. Kanbei got drunk, they took the Mora in the store and strolled out leisurely.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180614"
            ]
          },
          "220180614": {
            "id": "220180614",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Kanbei has been coming over for several days to ask me to find the culprit. Honestly, I'm getting sick of that loud voice of his.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180615"
            ]
          },
          "220180615": {
            "id": "220180615",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "As such, I'd like to ask you and Ryuuji to go check out how he's doing and listen to, well, his complaints.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180616"
            ]
          },
          "220180616": {
            "id": "220180616",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "After that, go ask around a bit. Let's see if anyone saw or heard anything while the theft was ongoing at Shimura's.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220180617"
            ]
          },
          "220180617": {
            "id": "220180617",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Come back and tell me when you're done. I'll be here waiting for you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
