        "dialogs": {
          "220181801": {
            "id": "220181801",
            "speakerId": 3005,
            "speakerName": "Furuya Noboru",
            "text": "But if you need proof that I was on Guild premises at the time, you can ask Katheryne."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2201819",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "220181901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "220181901": {
            "id": "220181901",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "You're back. How was it? Did you find anything out?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220181902"
            ]
          },
          "220181902": {
            "id": "220181902",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Well... I see... Thank you. You did a great job.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220181903"
            ]
          },
          "220181903": {
            "id": "220181903",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "This culprit really knows how to pick his targets. Aside from Mr. Kanbei, the owner of Netsuke no Gen Crafts, Mikoshi Genichirou, was also a victim.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220181904"
            ]
          },
          "220181904": {
            "id": "220181904",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Our culprit also somehow knew that Genichirou is in the habit of visiting a friend every so often, and committed the theft of quite a few valuable items while he was away.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220181905"
            ]
          },
          "220181905": {
            "id": "220181905",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "Ah, right. Miss Yayoi's lacquerware store was also hit. When she went out on a delivery run, a lot of pricey lacquerware was stolen from the store.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220181907"
            ]
          },
          "220181907": {
            "id": "220181907",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "That's right. But as you can see, there aren't many merchants or residents on this street. If a local committed the crime, someone would figure it out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220181908"
            ]
          },
          "220181908": {
            "id": "220181908",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "But if it wasn't a local, how could the culprit be so precise about when the victims would leave their stores?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220181910"
            ]
          },
          "220181910": {
            "id": "220181910",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "I also considered that. After Amano and Andou checked the whereabouts of the surrounding households and businesses, the possibility of a local committing the crime has been ruled out.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220181911"
            ]
          },
          "220181911": {
            "id": "220181911",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "The locations of the crime were scattered. It seems like they were done on a whim by Treasure Hoarders roaming into the city...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220181912"
            ]
          },
          "220181912": {
            "id": "220181912",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "But the methods used are rather precise, and the culprit covered their tracks very well. It doesn't look at all like the Treasure Hoarders' usual handiwork.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220181913"
            ]
          },
          "220181913": {
            "id": "220181913",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "I believe that... perhaps the thief personally scouted out and collected information about the lives of people around the city to make their plans...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "220181914"
            ]
          },
          "220181914": {
            "id": "220181914",
            "speakerId": 3041,
            "speakerName": "Sango",
            "text": "As I said, there aren't many residents here and they all know each other. If there were any strangers amongst them, everyone would have noticed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2201820",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
